g. coordinating with other companions; and h. providing continuous handling up to the rehabilitation stage.

Article 57

Clusters of children's rights as referred to in Article 56 paragraph (4) letter b which include:
a. Civil rights and freedoms which include:
1. children's right to identity;
2. right to protection of identity;
