1. To make the development of a Child-Friendly Regency effective, a Child-Friendly Regency Task Force is formed which is established by Regent's Decree.
2. Membership of the Child-Friendly Regency Task Force as referred to in paragraph (1) may come from the Regional Government, children's representatives, the business sector, religious leaders, community leaders and other parties as needed.
